me trouble.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["meimei",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Murong Xuechuan:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["(All memories related to Boss Deer"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["have been erased.)"]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["BUST LEFT FALSE"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["hetao",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Walnut:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Walnut just drifted along with the"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["current... and became a rare kitty at"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["the Inari Shrine..."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["hetao",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Walnut:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["like a dandelion seed carried by the"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["wind for thousands of miles to a foreign"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["land, lost and helpless."]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["BUST RIGHT FALSE"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["meimei",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Murong Xuechuan:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Why did you suddenly say something so"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["literary?!"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"About Beast-Trapping Island"]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["BUST RIGHT FALSE"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["meimei",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Murong Xuechuan:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["If you're a Mengji, there should be"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["some way to leave this place, right?"]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["BUST LEFT FALSE"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["hetao",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Walnut:"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I'm sorry. This place isn't completely a"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["dream, so my abilit